    "name_raw": "Merciful Takedown",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Martial Arts Handbook pg. 26",
    "definition_raw": "Source Martial Arts Handbook pg. 26\nYou are adept at removing your defeated opponents from the fight while avoiding their deaths.\n\nBenefit: When you perform a coup de grace and deal only nonlethal damage, instead of attempting a Fortitude save to avoid death, the target must instead attempt a Fortitude save to avoid falling unconscious for 1 hour. The DC of this save is the same as that of a lethal coup de grace.",
